    "$t": "2025百字寫台文tio̍h獎作品 - 大學組"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《2025百字寫台文tio̍h獎作品 - 大學組》</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWQSR65vyXpHEzXIR7J7r8qa-mFwXKI2M61unPC8s4cLv6MPqPM4JkNTGRevHS9q3468mi-PyShyKTgFs7Vkgc4U1Lleo6iZbzeDl-aSKmOAe1j36Veg7okeFpYOFw4sMnnHvXqgr75Ky6C-LQ4hQI0DMB7INU69KgFohsbwyp1zbmFVy5kO6usG0xQ1XR\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWQSR65vyXpHEzXIR7J7r8qa-mFwXKI2M61unPC8s4cLv6MPqPM4JkNTGRevHS9q3468mi-PyShyKTgFs7Vkgc4U1Lleo6iZbzeDl-aSKmOAe1j36Veg7okeFpYOFw4sMnnHvXqgr75Ky6C-LQ4hQI0DMB7INU69KgFohsbwyp1zbmFVy5kO6usG0xQ1XR\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjW1UvkEvEYBkwDrQ8N_tRJjAFNJhpbhoRBLG_qsTQtje42m7Ydc8kBwBxctF_QeP6QZUuTIZ3NxuTqxY-E-L4MtyRJGDqqrFNBV3ovBIlxA6R1Yo_FixKKzWjXpwNQWyVTi6T35rKrbz2zsyaBVrhUJRDtxVGtw807g7UMDXu58VCoBPb9zvI5hOs7yjW2\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjW1UvkEvEYBkwDrQ8N_tRJjAFNJhpbhoRBLG_qsTQtje42m7Ydc8kBwBxctF_QeP6QZUuTIZ3NxuTqxY-E-L4MtyRJGDqqrFNBV3ovBIlxA6R1Yo_FixKKzWjXpwNQWyVTi6T35rKrbz2zsyaBVrhUJRDtxVGtw807g7UMDXu58VCoBPb9zvI5hOs7yjW2=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXfXldCycqXuAbUJZOU35IlgE20KfC9ZumKTtkorlivhTE6at__NWaI8YW3hCqQjDN9vhDU2eZtKlLloTHfy52tX6vLT80s05jzTY2NqMSKARNcScpe2mJli3Ohud6wStyoBCJKnGfsiWCUjDUNdwA56svJnj19I2o4_NzBnp8gB63u_3GirdSO8I6gBME\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXfXldCycqXuAbUJZOU35IlgE20KfC9ZumKTtkorlivhTE6at__NWaI8YW3hCqQjDN9vhDU2eZtKlLloTHfy52tX6vLT80s05jzTY2NqMSKARNcScpe2mJli3Ohud6wStyoBCJKnGfsiWCUjDUNdwA56svJnj19I2o4_NzBnp8gB63u_3GirdSO8I6gBME\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgGbgwojDehzjX20ZMR-yd5rIQjf_NxS9992j9biqs8JMPc4-P6Xclwrd72ZhTNAhGW_9q-wCyfqiGZ_QjUAA0aGOLjk9lMp6arUdLYaCpuPUMR0b7cDOaR8-M8LkfHfadoZj6gGHM2wDTEHbr-ajdNHYgCFaWOjauleiL4GllwuPtVFwHxqe3ckmmMfXB3\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXfXldCycqXuAbUJZOU35IlgE20KfC9ZumKTtkorlivhTE6at__NWaI8YW3hCqQjDN9vhDU2eZtKlLloTHfy52tX6vLT80s05jzTY2NqMSKARNcScpe2mJli3Ohud6wStyoBCJKnGfsiWCUjDUNdwA56svJnj19I2o4_NzBnp8gB63u_3GirdSO8I6gBME=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgGbgwojDehzjX20ZMR-yd5rIQjf_NxS9992j9biqs8JMPc4-P6Xclwrd72ZhTNAhGW_9q-wCyfqiGZ_QjUAA0aGOLjk9lMp6arUdLYaCpuPUMR0b7cDOaR8-M8LkfHfadoZj6gGHM2wDTEHbr-ajdNHYgCFaWOjauleiL4GllwuPtVFwHxqe3ckmmMfXB3=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWQSR65vyXpHEzXIR7J7r8qa-mFwXKI2M61unPC8s4cLv6MPqPM4JkNTGRevHS9q3468mi-PyShyKTgFs7Vkgc4U1Lleo6iZbzeDl-aSKmOAe1j36Veg7okeFpYOFw4sMnnHvXqgr75Ky6C-LQ4hQI0DMB7INU69KgFohsbwyp1zbmFVy5kO6usG0xQ1XR=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></div><br /><br /><br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">徐廷睿Tshî Tîng-luē</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立臺灣師範大學臺灣語文學系）/ 優等</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">秀英含蕊縫先li̍h，也ē抹粉點胭脂，打扮一身tsiah標緻，天生自然無刁持。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">秀英大phō就pun-le，枝尾ǹg塗頭tàm-sê，生suí哪tio̍h驚歹勢，現現面肉to tsiah白。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">秀英出世芳茉莉，開花tio̍h-ài等暗暝，若到三更半睏醒，鼻著花味芳kah甜。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">秀英長有兩三尺，纏纏絆絆軟iô-iô，有鼻無看tsiânn可惜，手雕花枝挽kah tio̍h。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">第一感謝眾前輩，唸歌寫書來栽培，學問在前做肥底，贊我今日開suí花。</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">第二感謝我本身，對待台語有認真，老師序大tàu引進，學習路途有貴人。</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">第三感謝李江却，好運hōo lín揀有著，歌仔文學ài寶惜，做陣來寫免礙虐。</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳昱儒Tân Io̍k-jû</b></span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span><span>（國立清華大學）/ 優等</span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>一世人</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">出世落塗</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">頭過身就過</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一歲是奶水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">食飽睏飽</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">是一暝大一寸ê祝福</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">十歲是墨水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">讀冊寫字</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一百分是ǹg望ê人生</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">二十是海水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">日出日落</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">浪漫青春是阮ê形影</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">三十、四十是汗水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄驚風雨</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">總是為著生活leh拍拚</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">五十、六十是珠淚</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">不時操煩</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">囝兒食頭路kám有順序</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">七十、八十是燒水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">泡一鈷茶</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">保存愈陳愈芳ê記持</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">九十、一百是雨水</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">歡喜祝福</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Iah是鹹酸苦澀過一生</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">最後一工</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">過身行過tsit世人</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b><span>感謝心得</span></b></div><div><span><div>學台語字音字形ê時間超過十年，開始體會著創作m̄-nā需要豐富ê生活經驗kah思考，mā需要去斟酌學--過ê詞kah文句。「學了，ài ē-hiáu用」是我學習台語文上大ê體悟，我mā替家己ē-hiáu寫、ē-tàng寫台灣ê語言感覺真幸運mā真歡喜。</div></span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>黃資淇N̂g Chu-kî</b></span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span><span>（國立成功大學台灣文學系）/ 優等</span></div><div><span><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>去揣心內ê人</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hit个下晡，天koh有小可仔冬尾ê風，舊冊店、香店、iáu未拆掉ê鷹架，tī古城，日頭照tī紅磚仔ê壁頂。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行入佛寺，廟門無大，chūn-chūn香火，邊--a是老人leh誦經，少年人攑香拜拜，我點香行到月老面頭前，心內leh想hit个人。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">下晡時仔ê風，恬恬仔吹過我心肝底上軟ê所在。月老ê籤文tī手頭，文字親像一pha電火，照光我心內hit條iap-thiap ê溪。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tī廟內，我看著家己心內ê月影。月娘總是tī人看bē著ê所在，恬恬仔守護夜色；每一擺想著伊，心頭就有微微仔稀微——期待ē-tàng kap伊做雙方ê牽手，mā驚家己錯失hit份溫柔。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">- chit篇ê羅馬字是傳統白話字</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">我是一个Makatao人，mā是一个台語人，chit-má台灣逐个族群ê文化kap語言lóng沓沓仔稀微，傳承語言kap文化是阮chit代台灣人ê義務，感謝評審hō͘我chit个獎，未來我ē繼續創作，ǹg望台語kap台灣lóng ē-tàng出頭天！</span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>王詩涵Ông Si-hâm</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（臺北市立大學中國語文學系）/ 佳作</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>暗暝ê掠夢人</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">暗時ê街巷tsiânn恬靜，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">路燈tshiō我ê形影，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">kah我做伙一步一步行，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我看著塗跤閃爍ê影，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">mā聽著風吹--來ê聲，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">親像有人leh nauh：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Tsit爿是過去，hit爿是未來。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">行過無尾巷，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我m̄知beh行去佗，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">kan-na知影ài一直行，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我想beh掠著光——hit款溫暖ê光。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有人講夢是tī-leh日頭照bē著ê所在，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我參我ê夢，kah日頭bih-sio揣，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我相信行tī暗暝ê掠夢人，</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ē等待，我揣著夢ê hit工。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsiânn歡喜〈暗暝ê掠夢人〉ē-tàng得著佳作。因為我ê作品有一寡所在ē khah成華文，所以tsiânn感謝學長kah我做伙討論作品ê細節，hōo tsit首詩ē-tàng koh-khah倚近台語ê味。無，本底我掠準講我會參我ê夢，kah名次bih-sio揣。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>李荃林Lí Tsuân-lîm</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立臺中教育大學）/ 佳作</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>肚臍kah語言</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人講：「語言是文化ê肚臍」，借長長ê臍帶kā性命ê源頭牽tiâu--著，若kah án-ne，文化kah肚臍kám有啥mih tī代？因端出tī文化是真本實料ê寶貝，若無tuan-tiah ê語言，就無才調展現出suí-khuì飽tīnn ê傳統文化。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我南北二路走揣台灣ê宮廟寺院逐間se̍h透透，雄雄mé想--著，若bē-tàng kā廟寺所保存ê傳統文化kōo台語來保存、轉變做有聲、有影ê文化財，就kánn-ná是恬恬bē講話ê é-káu niā-niā。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">講台語，我驕傲，tse是現此時台灣人上燒lō ê心聲，mā替正港ê台灣人，揣著上kài光明ê大路。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsit擺tio̍h獎，對我來講是一種鼓舞，mā是對母語深情ê回應。台語m̄-nā是溝通ê工具，koh是文化ê靈魂。透過書寫，我希望hōo koh-khah濟人聽--著、看--著、感受台語ê suí kah力量。感謝評審kah主辦單位ê肯定，mā感謝一路支持母語ê朋友，lán做伙守護tsit條文化ê大路。</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>賴姿穎Luā Tsu-íng</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立臺中教育大學）/ 佳作</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">Ē記得我細漢ê時tsūn，我tiānn-tiānn hām阿媽sak iáu無啥ē-hiáu行路ê小妹去散步。有一改，拄著庄內無偌熟sāi ê厝邊，伊ná弄坐tī紅嬰仔車內底ê小妹，ná hām阿媽開講，到tsia lóng無我ê代誌。一直到伊越頭看著我，開喙問阿媽：「月--ê，tse你細漢新婦--ooh？」</span></div><div><div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hit年，我12歲。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsit个故事我當做笑詼講hōo真濟人知，mā m̄是第一改用寫--ê hām逐家分享。M̄-koh過去按怎寫lóng欠一味，tsit改寫--出-來，tsiah知影欠ê hit味是語言。佳哉，我kā我ê筆揣--tńg-來--ah。Ǹg望後日仔所有ê人lóng ē-tàng kā筆揣--tńg-來。</span></div></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>洪健勛Âng Kiān-hun</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立臺中教育大學台灣語文學系）/ 佳作</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>視線，gōng膽</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">雨moa long--leh，就bē驚，mā免驚落雨--ah。熱--人，西北雨tiāⁿ來chak-chō，tī過晝好chhit-thô ê時站來攪擾，ōe麵線。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán ê目睭慣勢kā眼前ê水珠拍霧，方便看清khah遠ê hit搭，是紅--ê a̍h是青--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">騎車mā像leh做人，看koân也tio̍h看低。若無張持kauh著窟仔，頓一下pōng水花--無-打-緊，koh潑著過路人，chit聲m̄-nā食力，tio̍h koh食拳頭拇--lio͘h。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">- chit篇ê羅馬字是傳統白話字</span></div><div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">在座ê貴賓、有志，koh有tio̍h獎人逐家平安。感謝主辦單位舉辦chit个徵文活動，hō͘我有chit个機緣來展跤手，kā心內ê理念用khah文學性ê手路表達--出-來。Chit擺入選hō͘我chiok大ê肯定kap信心，後過mā ē繼續接觸文學、拍拚行入文學。多謝，ló͘-la̍t！</span></div></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>林家慶Lîm Ka-khìng</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立政治大學）/ 佳作</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Hit工hōo我知影，啥mi̍h是真正ê富貴。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">歇熱ê時，我tuè厝邊阿叔去做水電。頭一工就拄著一場硬táu--ê，做無偌久就腹肚iau-sò-sò--ah。總算等到食晝，阮去食自助餐。阿叔也tsiânn勤儉，拚死拚活，盤仔底油tsho--ê kan-na一粒卵包。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">坐落來食ê時，阮看著邊--a一个烏ta瘦，衫仔褲破糊糊ê濟歲人，kan-na食一碗白飯配免錢ê湯。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿叔真a̍t-sá-lih，隨kā伊hit粒卵包ngeh hōo--伊，家己食青菜配飯。尾--à koh ke包幾个菜hōo--伊，叫伊ài食khah飽--leh，khah有khuì力。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">原來富貴m̄是家己趁偌濟錢銀，是阮ē-tàng hōo tsit个社會偌濟愛心。</span></div></div><div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">我有一个夢，就是ē-tàng用母語寫出、講出家己ê故事。拄仔好有tsit个比賽ē-tàng hām逐家分享我人生當中一寡仔感受kah體會。Tī網路tsit个充滿華語ê媒介來寫台文，koh-khah代表台語無phīng人khah bái，lán台灣需要一个多元ê語言空間，講台語是我ê驕傲。</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: 